{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cue","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"CUE","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CUE (.cue).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"cue","name":"CUE","extensions":[".cue"],"grammar":"grammars/cue.json","lineComment":"//"}],"snippets":[{"language":"CUE","path":"snippets/cue.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/cue.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"'''\",\n      \"end\": \"'''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*|_#[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[a-z]+\\\\([^)]*\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*\\\"?[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*\\\"?\\\\??!?(?=\\\\s*:)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:package|import|false|true|null|let|for|_\\\\|_|div|mod|quo|rem|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:float32|float64|string|number|uint16|uint32|uint64|float|bytes|int16|int32|int64|uint8|bool|uint|int8|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/cue.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Schema\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#${1:Name}: {\",\n      \"\\t${2:field}: ${3:string}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A definition\"\n  },\n  \"Constraint\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cons\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:port}: int & >=1 & <=65535\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A constrained field\"\n  },\n  \"Package\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pkg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"package ${1:config}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A package\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# CUE\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CUE.\n\n## Files\n\n`.cue`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `def` | A definition |\n| `cons` | A constrained field |\n| `pkg` | A package |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}